sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant Web as Next.js App<br/>(/submit)
    participant API as Typed API Client<br/>(developerApi)
    participant Mock as MSW Handler<br/>(developer.ts)
    participant DB as Mock DB + Scheduler

    Dev->>Web: Select .sol file, bounty amount, deadline
    Web->>Web: Validate extension (.sol) and size (<=100KB)
    Web->>API: submitContract(file, bountyAmount, deadline)
    API->>Mock: POST /api/contracts (multipart FormData)
    Mock->>DB: createContract()
    DB->>DB: Store Contract (status=Open) + Bounty
    DB->>DB: scheduleOnce("analysis:<id>", ~3s)
    DB-->>Mock: Contract
    Mock-->>API: 201 Contract
    API-->>Web: Contract (parsed via ContractSchema)
    Web->>Dev: Redirect to /contracts/:id

    Note over Web,DB: Web polls GET /api/contracts/:id/findings every 2s

    DB->>DB: Timer fires: generateFindingsForContract()
    DB->>DB: Findings created, status=Flagged,<br/>statusHistory=[{Flagged, now}]

    Web->>API: listFindings(contractId)
    API->>Mock: GET /api/contracts/:id/findings
    Mock->>DB: listFindingsByContract()
    DB-->>Mock: Finding[]
    Mock-->>API: 200 Finding[]
    API-->>Web: Finding[] (parsed via FindingSchema)
    Web->>Dev: Render findings (severity, LLM explanation, raw output toggle)
